note.p:
“Calls upon the People’s Republic of China promptly
                    to make clear its intent not to attack Taiwan (Formosa) and the Penghus
                    (Pescadores) with force, and to abstain from any such attack;

“Calls upon the Republic of China reciprocally to
                    abstain from using Taiwan (Formosa) and the Penghus (Pescadores) as a base for
                    armed attack against the Mainland of China;
